\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God has given me a Book full of stories,
\par Which was made for His people of old,
\par It begins with a tale of garden,
\par And ends with the city of gold.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. But the best is the story of Jesus,
\par Of the Babe with the ox in the stall,
\par Of the song that was sung by the angels,
\par The most beautiful story of all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. There are stories for parents and children,
\par For the old who are ready to rest,
\par But for all who can read them or listen,
\par The story of Jesus is best.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. For it tells how He came from The Father,
\par His far-away children to call,
\par To bring the lost sheep to their Shepherd,
\par The most beautiful story of all.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

